    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fec20ed81c92856ad4895db",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "杏目精彩地拿下了经典级的首战。\n在她的赛后疲劳也逐渐恢复的几天后――",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4e2d4dadfcadafcafa8352df94f6dd25f42c2f9aed3e68c248c56988270a0ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
