      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "完美！　比赛结束后\n也没有像出道战那次有强烈的疲惫感……。\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "078c12f2347021e595553935c128b41c477c605c21ee67b26d458f0dd87482a5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
