      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然赛后的护理还会继续，\n但是『情绪超前于身体』的情况\n似乎不会再出现了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "07f283309008931ebd4eeceb5e5910512271dd375ab3bfa3a76031b79521ad4a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
